{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1037607-ascended-by-wisdom-anyone-have-seen-one","id":1037607,"title":"Ascended by Wisdom - Anyone have seen one?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-24T19:59:15-08:00","id":1037607,"title":"Ascended by Wisdom - Anyone have seen one?","content":"So one of my games will need some mages ( or their remains <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) that Ascended by Wisdom - Do we have any canon ones? Does not Corpus Author Ascended by this 'virtue'? If not, have you got any ideas on those?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-24T22:07:14-08:00","id":1037668,"title":"","content":"The Corpus Author is mentioned as an example of the Supernal Work, not a Wisdom Ascension, though that's &quot;suggested&quot;; the explicit cause is left unstated.<br /> <br /> For me, I'd make a Wisdom Ascension one requiring the Mage to correct their own impacts on the world until they're entirely in-keeping with the Mage's ideals. Not an easy feat, since doing so ostensibly requires rewriting as many of the things they <i>didn't</i> do as the things they did. A Mage may have to rewrite their entire personal history with Time magic but it's far more likely they try and correct past mistakes and/or purge the parts of their soul that make them sin against Wisdom in Astral sojourns or some similarly drastic measure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-25T04:02:02-08:00","id":1037757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1037607-ascended-by-wisdom-anyone-have-seen-one?p=1037668#post1037668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For me, I'd make a Wisdom Ascension one requiring the Mage to correct their own impacts on the world until they're entirely in-keeping with the Mage's ideals. Not an easy feat, since doing so ostensibly requires rewriting as many of the things they <i>didn't</i> do as the things they did. A Mage may have to rewrite their entire personal history with Time magic but it's far more likely they try and correct past mistakes and/or purge the parts of their soul that make them sin against Wisdom in Astral sojourns or some similarly drastic measure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Reminds me a lot of Golconda and the New Dawn. Something so epic and grand, yet intensely personal at the same time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-25T05:31:45-08:00","id":1037778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1037607-ascended-by-wisdom-anyone-have-seen-one?p=1037757#post1037757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something so epic and grand, yet intensely personal at the same time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ascension.txt, really.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}